      "title": "LDAP Connector: Resolving Access Denials and Certificate Warnings",
      "content_summary": "Troubleshooting steps for LDAP Connector issues such as account lockouts, access denials, and expired certificate warnings.",
      "content_body": "When users report access denied or account lockout events, first check the audit logs for missing entries or elevated privilege anomalies. These symptoms are frequently caused by credential rotation that has not propagated correctly or by an expired certificate on the connector server. To resolve, ensure you renew the certificate and force a credential rotation across all affected nodes. Finally, complete an improper access review to update permissions and clear any lingering security policy violations."
